Note, Word Predictor GUI Version.

Note, Global state.
Let vocab sz be 0.
Create a list called idx to word.
Create a dictionary called word to idx.
Create a list called weights.
Let generated text be none.
Let model loaded be no.

Note, Load model from database.
Define load model,
    Open a database called word predictor.
    Select from config and store in cfg rows.
    Let ci be 1.
    While the value of ci is less than or equal to the length of cfg rows,
        Let row be item ci of cfg rows.
        Let k be the entry key in row.
        Let v be the entry val in row.
        If the value of k is equal to vocabsize,
            Set vocab sz to the number of v.
        End if.
        Add 1 to ci.
    End while.
    Select from vocab and store in vocab rows.
    Create a list called new idx to word.
    Create a dictionary called new word to idx.
    Let si be 1.
    While the value of si is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Add placeholder to new idx to word.
        Add 1 to si.
    End while.
    Let vi be 1.
    While the value of vi is less than or equal to the length of vocab rows,
        Let row be item vi of vocab rows.
        Let w be the entry word in row.
        Let raw idx be the entry idx in row.
        Let idx be the number of raw idx.
        Set item idx of new idx to word to the value of w.
        Set the entry the value of w in new word to idx to the value of idx.
        Add 1 to vi.
    End while.
    Set idx to word to the value of new idx to word.
    Set word to idx to the value of new word to idx.
    Select from weights and store in w rows.
    Create a list called new weights.
    Let total w be the value of vocab sz times vocab sz.
    Let si be 1.
    While the value of si is less than or equal to total w,
        Add 0 to new weights.
        Add 1 to si.
    End while.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to the length of w rows,
        Let row be item wi of w rows.
        Let raw pos be the entry pos in row.
        Let pos be the number of raw pos.
        Let raw val be the entry val in row.
        Let val be the number of raw val.
        Set item pos of new weights to the value of val.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Set weights to the value of new weights.
    Close the database.
    Set model loaded to yes.
    Call show ui.
End define.

Note, Predict next word given current word index.
Define predict next that takes from idx,
    Create a list called logits.
    Let row offset be the value of from idx minus 1 times vocab sz.
    Let ki be 1.
    While the value of ki is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let widx be the value of row offset plus ki.
        Let logit be item widx of weights.
        Add logit to logits.
        Add 1 to ki.
    End while.
    Let max logit be the max of logits.
    Create a list called probs.
    Let exp total be 0.
    Let ki be 1.
    While the value of ki is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let logit be item ki of logits.
        Let shifted be the value of logit minus max logit.
        Let ex be the exponential of shifted.
        Add ex to probs.
        Set exp total to the value of exp total plus ex.
        Add 1 to ki.
    End while.
    Let ki be 1.
    While the value of ki is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let p be item ki of probs.
        Set item ki of probs to the value of p divided by exp total.
        Add 1 to ki.
    End while.
    Let best idx be 1.
    Let best prob be item 1 of probs.
    Let ki be 2.
    While the value of ki is less than or equal to vocab sz,
        Let p be item ki of probs.
        If the value of p is greater than best prob,
            Set best idx to the value of ki.
            Set best prob to the value of p.
        End if.
        Add 1 to ki.
    End while.
    Return the value of best idx.
End define.

Note, Handle single prediction.
Define handle predict,
    If the value of model loaded is equal to no,
        Say Load the model first.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let seed be the text box inputword.
    Let seed lower be the lowercase of seed.
    If not the value of word to idx has the entry the value of seed lower,
        Set generated text to Unknown word.
        Call show ui.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let current idx be the entry the value of seed lower in word to idx.
    Call predict next with the value of current idx and store the result in next idx.
    Let next word be item next idx of idx to word.
    Set generated text to the value of seed lower joined with space joined with next word.
    Call show ui.
End define.

Note, Handle auto generate.
Define handle auto,
    If the value of model loaded is equal to no,
        Say Load the model first.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let seed be the text box inputword.
    Let seed lower be the lowercase of seed.
    If not the value of word to idx has the entry the value of seed lower,
        Set generated text to Unknown word.
        Call show ui.
        Return 0.
    End if.
    Let raw count be the text box wordcount.
    Let max words be the number of raw count.
    Let current idx be the entry the value of seed lower in word to idx.
    Create a list called result words.
    Add the value of seed lower to result words.
    Let wi be 1.
    While the value of wi is less than or equal to max words,
        Call predict next with the value of current idx and store the result in next idx.
        Let next word be item next idx of idx to word.
        Add the value of next word to result words.
        Set current idx to the value of next idx.
        Add 1 to wi.
    End while.
    Let output be item 1 of result words.
    Let oi be 2.
    While the value of oi is less than or equal to the length of result words,
        Let w be item oi of result words.
        Set output to the value of output joined with space joined with w.
        Add 1 to oi.
    End while.
    Set generated text to the value of output.
    Call show ui.
End define.

Note, Build the UI.
Define show ui,
    Clear window.
    Add label Word Predictor.
    If the value of model loaded is equal to no,
        Add label Please load model first.
        Add button with text Load Model that calls load model.
    End if.
    If the value of model loaded is equal to yes,
        Add label Model ready.
        Add label Enter a starting word.
        Add text box inputword.
        Add button with text Predict Next that calls handle predict.
        Add label Word count for auto generate.
        Add text box wordcount.
        Add button with text Auto Generate that calls handle auto.
    End if.
    If the value of generated text is not equal to none,
        Add label Generated text.
        Add label the value of generated text.
    End if.
End define.

Note, Launch window.
Open window with title Word Predictor.
Set window size to 500 by 500.
Set background color to #1e1e2e.
Set text color to #cdd6f4.
Set font size to 13.
Call show ui.
Wait for close.
